## 🛠️ STACK TECHNOLOGICZNY

### Frontend
```json
{
  "framework": "React 18.2.0",
  "typescript": "5.2.2",
  "build": "Vite 5.1.4",
  "styling": "Tailwind CSS 3.4.1",
  "icons": "Lucide React 0.359.0",
  "routing": "React Router DOM 6.22.3",
  "state": "Zustand 4.5.1",
  "maps": "React Leaflet 4.2.1 + Leaflet 1.9.4",
  "charts": "Chart.js 4.4.1 + React ChartJS 2 5.2.0",
  "dates": "date-fns 3.3.1",
  "pwa": "vite-plugin-pwa 1.1.0 + workbox-window 7.3.0"
}
```

### Backend & Database
```json
{
  "database": "Supabase (PostgreSQL)",
  "auth": "Supabase Auth (Email/Password + OAuth)",
  "storage": "Supabase Storage (dla zdjęć ryb)",
  "edge-functions": "Supabase Edge Functions (Deno)",
  "realtime": "Supabase Realtime (opcjonalne)"
}
```

### External APIs
- **Open-Meteo** - Bezpłatne API pogodowe (główne źródło)
- **Netatmo** - OAuth weather API (opcjonalne, dla stacji domowych)

