## 🗄️ KONFIGURACJA BAZY DANYCH

### Inicjalizacja Supabase:

1. **Utwórz projekt w Supabase**
   - Wejdź na https://supabase.com
   - Utwórz nowy projekt
   - Zapisz **Project URL** i **Anon Key**

2. **Skonfiguruj zmienne środowiskowe**
   ```bash
   VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://twoj-projekt.supabase.co
   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbG...
   ```

3. **Uruchom migracje**
   - Wszystkie 42 migracje są w folderze `supabase/migrations/`
   - Można je uruchomić przez Supabase Dashboard lub CLI
   - Migracje tworzą całą strukturę bazy danych

---

## 🔗 SCHEMAT BAZY DANYCH

### Główne tabele:

#### 1. **user_profiles**
```sql
CREATE TABLE user_profiles (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES auth.users(id),
  email TEXT NOT NULL,
  full_name TEXT,
  avatar_url TEXT,
  provider TEXT DEFAULT 'email' NOT NULL,  -- 'email', 'google', 'github'
  provider_id TEXT,
  role TEXT DEFAULT 'user' CHECK (role IN ('user', 'admin')),
  enable_quick_count BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
```

**RLS Policies:**
- Users can view own profile
- Users can update own profile
- Admins can view all profiles

#### 2. **fishing_sessions**
```sql
CREATE TABLE fishing_sessions (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES auth.users(id),
  start_time TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  end_time TIMESTAMPTZ,
  weather JSONB NOT NULL,                  -- Dane pogodowe
  locations JSONB[] NOT NULL,              -- Tablica lokalizacji GPS
  notes TEXT,
  pauses JSONB[] DEFAULT '{}',             -- Pauzy w sesji
  total_pause_time INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  tracking_interval INTEGER DEFAULT 15 CHECK (tracking_interval IN (1,5,15,30,60)),
  tracking_enabled BOOLEAN DEFAULT true,
  counting_mode BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,
  just_count_mode BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
```

**RLS Policies:**
- Users can CRUD own sessions
- Sessions are user-scoped

#### 3. **fish_catches**
```sql
CREATE TABLE fish_catches (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  session_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES fishing_sessions(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  species TEXT NOT NULL,
  length NUMERIC NOT NULL,
  weight NUMERIC NOT NULL,
  location JSONB NOT NULL,                 -- {lat, lng, timestamp}
  weather JSONB,                           -- Dane pogodowe dla złowienia
  photo_urls TEXT[],                       -- Zdjęcia ryb
  description TEXT,                        -- Opis złowienia
  notes TEXT,
  timestamp TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
```

**RLS Policies:**
- Users can CRUD catches for their own sessions

#### 4. **fish_species** (13 gatunków)
```sql
CREATE TABLE fish_species (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  code TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,               -- 'CARP', 'PIKE', 'PERCH', etc.
  name_en TEXT NOT NULL,
  name_pl TEXT NOT NULL,
  name_de TEXT NOT NULL,
  latin_name TEXT NOT NULL,
  group_name TEXT NOT NULL,                -- 'Predator', 'Peaceful', etc.
  min_length INTEGER NOT NULL,
  max_length INTEGER NOT NULL,
  max_weight NUMERIC NOT NULL,
  description_pl TEXT,
  description_en TEXT,
  description_de TEXT,
  habitat_pl TEXT,
  habitat_en TEXT,
  habitat_de TEXT,
  feeding_pl TEXT,
  feeding_en TEXT,
  feeding_de TEXT,
  spawning_pl TEXT,
  spawning_en TEXT,
  spawning_de TEXT,
  legal_size INTEGER,                      -- Minimalna długość połowu
  protected_period_start DATE,
  protected_period_end DATE,
  image_url TEXT,
  thumbnail_url TEXT,
  length_weight_data JSONB,                -- Dane do obliczania wagi z długości
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
```

**Domyślne gatunki:**
- Karp (CARP)
- Szczupak (PIKE)
- Okoń (PERCH)
- Sum (CATFISH)
- Sandacz (ZANDER)
- Leszcz (BREAM)
- Lin (TENCH)
- Karaś (CRUCIAN_CARP)
- Płoć (ROACH)
- Amur (GRASS_CARP)
- Tołpyga (SILVER_CARP)
- Pstrąg (TROUT)
- Jaź (CHUB)

**RLS Policies:**
- Everyone can read
- Only admins can modify

#### 5. **weather_api_providers**
```sql
CREATE TABLE weather_api_providers (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  name TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,               -- 'open-meteo', 'netatmo'
  display_name TEXT NOT NULL,
  api_url TEXT NOT NULL,
  requires_key BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,
  enabled BOOLEAN DEFAULT true,
  priority INTEGER DEFAULT 0,              -- 0 = highest priority
  last_sync_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
  last_successful_sync_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
  sync_interval_minutes INTEGER DEFAULT 5,
  sync_error_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  last_sync_error TEXT,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
```

**RLS Policies:**
- Everyone can read providers
- Only admins can modify

#### 6. **weather_oauth_config**
```sql
CREATE TABLE weather_oauth_config (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  provider_id UUID UNIQUE REFERENCES weather_api_providers(id),
  client_id TEXT NOT NULL,
  client_secret TEXT NOT NULL,
  access_token TEXT,
  refresh_token TEXT,
  token_expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
  redirect_uri TEXT DEFAULT '',
  scopes TEXT[] DEFAULT ARRAY[]::TEXT[],
  is_configured BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,
  last_token_refresh TIMESTAMPTZ,
  last_data_fetch_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
```

**RLS Policies:**
- Only admins can access

#### 7. **roadmap_items**
```sql
CREATE TABLE roadmap_items (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  title TEXT NOT NULL,
  description TEXT,
  status TEXT DEFAULT 'planned' CHECK (status IN ('planned', 'in_progress', 'completed')),
  phase INTEGER DEFAULT 1,
  priority INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
```

**RLS Policies:**
- Everyone can read
- Only admins can modify

#### 8. **app_versions** & **changelog_entries**
```sql
CREATE TABLE app_versions (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  version TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,
  release_date TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  is_current BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);

CREATE TABLE changelog_entries (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  version_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES app_versions(id),
  type TEXT CHECK (type IN ('added', 'changed', 'fixed', 'removed')),
  description TEXT NOT NULL,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
```

**RLS Policies:**
- Everyone can read
- Only admins can modify

#### 9. **user_onboarding**
```sql
CREATE TABLE user_onboarding (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  user_id UUID UNIQUE NOT NULL REFERENCES auth.users(id),
  completed BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,
  current_step INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  total_steps INTEGER DEFAULT 11,
  skipped BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,
  completed_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
  last_seen_step INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);
```

**RLS Policies:**
- Users can view and update own onboarding

#### 10. **Supabase Storage Buckets**

**fish-images** - dla zdjęć ryb
```sql
-- Bucket publiczny z RLS
-- Users mogą upload tylko do własnego folderu: user_id/*
-- Format: fish-images/user_id/session_id/catch_id_timestamp.jpg
```

