### Generowanie ikon PWA

**WAŻNE**: Logo to `public/images/clicka-logo.svg` - niebieska ryba z wędką.

**Skrypt generowania:**
```bash
# Z SVG generuj wszystkie rozmiary PNG
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 72x72 icon-72x72.png
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 96x96 icon-96x96.png
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 128x128 icon-128x128.png
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 144x144 icon-144x144.png
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 152x152 icon-152x152.png
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 192x192 icon-192x192.png
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 384x384 icon-384x384.png
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 512x512 icon-512x512.png

# Maskable icons (z tłem #2563eb)
convert -size 192x192 xc:"#2563eb" clicka-logo.svg -gravity center -resize 154x154 -composite icon-192x192-maskable.png
convert -size 512x512 xc:"#2563eb" clicka-logo.svg -gravity center -resize 410x410 -composite icon-512x512-maskable.png

# Apple Touch Icons
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 180x180 apple-touch-icon.png
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 76x76 apple-touch-icon-76x76.png
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 120x120 apple-touch-icon-120x120.png
convert -background none clicka-logo.svg -resize 152x152 apple-touch-icon-152x152.png
```

